      expect(controller.networkId, 'net9');
      expect(controller.mode, AppMode.network);
    });
```

I can insert `      await manager.disconnectAll();` before the final `});` of that test. Using sed: find the line `      expect(controller.mode, AppMode.network);` (unique, no secrets) and insert after it.

Let me check uniqueness.

